#: ../../book/comparison.rst:26
msgid "**Frontier AI weights**"
msgstr " **前沿大模型权重** "

#: ../../book/comparison.rst:27
msgid ""
"Proposed ``266504X(2)``: >=10^26 FLOPs, >=2T parameters, or Global Top-10 "
"rank at export; Core Data models ``266501J`` proposed prohibited; APIs "
"outside model export `CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"拟议266504X(2)：至少10^26次计算、2万亿参数或合格全球前十。266501J拟禁止，服务解释有特定适用范围。 `CN-A1 "
"<https://insanai.github.io/aiexportcontrols/sources/announcement-48-attachment-1.pdf>`_"
" `CNQA "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcjd/art/2026/art_b11d5c1e9374421e93e85dc87eba6e38.html>`_"

