#: ../../book/comparison.rst:36
msgid ""
"Consider a hypothetical lab working across China and Singapore that uses "
"covered chips and later licenses private model technology abroad. The chips,"
" parties and uses may engage US rules; the technology transfer may engage "
"Chinese registration. We must check the facts of each activity. One "
"permission does not settle the other system. `CN48 "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" `EAR734 <https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_ `EAR744 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/744>`_"
msgstr ""
"假设一个跨中国、新加坡的实验室使用覆盖芯片后境外许可私有技术。硬件、人员和用途可能涉及美国规则，技术转移可能涉及中国登记；一项许可不解决两个制度。 "
"`CN48 "
"<https://www.mofcom.gov.cn/zwgk/zcfb/art/2026/art_0a31a3c9ac404f7a9b0e917ce3412997.html>`_"
" `EAR734 <https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/734>`_ `EAR744 "
"<https://www.bis.gov/regulations/ear/744>`_"

#: ../../book/comparison.rst:38
msgid "Step-by-Step: How to Register or Apply for Official Approval"
msgstr "分步实操指南：如何办理信息登记或申领官方出口许可"

#: ../../book/comparison.rst:41
msgid ""
"Because most writing on export controls stops at ominous warnings, everyday "
"founders, open-source maintainers, university researchers, and equipment "
"buyers are left asking a simple practical question: *\"If our release, chip "
"tape-out, or partnership actually falls inside these rules, which government"
" department handles it, what portal do we open, how many working days does "
"approval take, and whom can we call or email?\"*"
msgstr ""
"市面上绝大多数关于出口管制的文章总是止步于渲染凝重警告，却让真正干实事的创业者、开源项目维护者、高校学者与设备采购方一头雾水地追问一个最朴素的实操问题："
"  "
"*“如果我们的模型发布、境外流片或国际合作真的落入了管制范围，究竟归哪个政府部门管？该打开哪个网站填报？法定审批需要多少个工作日？遇到疑问又该打哪个电话、发哪个邮箱？”*"
" "

