#: ../../book/comparison.rst:146
msgid ""
"The shared-workbench story now becomes a practical inquiry: what is being "
"transferred, which system covers it, and which route remains available? "
"Clear exclusions, usable procedures and credible continuing cooperation may "
"change incentives. Their effects need evidence; a completed form alone "
"cannot tell us whether cooperation has improved."
msgstr ""
"工作台故事现在成为实际问题：转移什么、哪个体系管辖、还剩哪条路径？明确排除、可用程序与可信持续合作可能改变激励。效果需要证据，填好表格本身不能证明合作已改善。"

